      "text": "Figure 6 — Grid of grey mobile wireframes comparing \"Zero-shot\", \"Few-shot\" and \"WireGen\" (columns) for two prompts (rows): \"search option for different flights\" (a bare list of boxed labels; a Book Flight form with Destination, Departure Date, Return Date; and a fuller Flights screen with ONE WAY/RETURN tabs, Departure/Arrival fields, date picker, passengers dropdown, \"Only direct flights\" checkbox and Search Flights button) and \"page of music list\" (boxed artist/song/genre cells; an empty \"No Music\" screen with Add Music; and a Music List with image rows for Artists, Songs, Genres, Moods, Festivals, Alarms, Favorites, a See More button and a bottom tab bar).",
